1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,067
When Pandora
lifted the lid,

2
00:00:02,067 --> 00:00:05,333
countless troubles spread
among humankind.

3
00:00:05,333 --> 00:00:07,633
Only hope stayed
inside, beneath

4
00:00:07,633 --> 00:00:09,433
the rim of the jar.

5
00:00:09,433 --> 00:00:10,633
The lid stopped it,

6
00:00:10,633 --> 00:00:12,467
by the will of Zeus.

7
00:00:12,467 --> 00:00:13,600
Was hope kept safe

8
00:00:13,600 --> 00:00:14,500
for us, or

9
00:00:14,500 --> 00:00:16,000
kept away from us?

10
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:17,667
Hesiod does not say.

11
00:00:17,667 --> 00:00:19,667
Full story on Quiet Origins
